{"id":"aat","name":"AAT","tagline":"Track your outdoor activities","blurb":"Track sportive activities while displaying them on cockpit and map view.","description":"Track sportive activities while displaying them on cockpit and map view.\nStore tracks in standard GPX format for sharing with other application.\n\nDisplay offline as well as tile based maps. Tile based overlays for displaying cycle and hiking routes (Waymarked Trails)\n\nIntegration of Offline POI and Nominatim map search. Display Offline POIs from Mapsforge compatible Databases.\n\nSimple GPX editor for quick route planning.\nGPS independent altitude information and hill shading.","developer":"bailuk","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/icons/128x128/ch.bailu.aat.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-1_1248x732@1.png","w":1484,"h":871},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-2_1248x732@1.png","w":1484,"h":871},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-3_752x1562@1.png","w":1080,"h":2244},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/ch/bailu/aat/ee9fed2346a700f1de357bed0694e9e1/screenshots/image-4_752x1562@1.png","w":1080,"h":2244}],"categories":["Utilities"],"tags":["utility"],"license":"GPL-3.0-or-later","platforms":["linux"],"homepage":"https://github.com/bailuk/AAT","stars":null,"version":"1.30.1","updated":"2